？","explanation":"acceptは「〜を受け取る」。","category":"Switch2単語","type":"choice","choices":["accept","disturb","focus","provide"],"answer":"accept","acceptableAnswers":["accept"]},{"id":"english_comm-engc017","moduleId":"english_comm","prompt":"Trees (   ) food and homes for many birds. に入る語は？","explanation":"provide A for Bの形で「BにAを提供する」。","category":"Switch2単語","type":"choice","choices":["provide","accept","focus","disturb"],"answer":"provide","acceptableAnswers":["provide"]},{"id":"english_comm-engc018","moduleId":"english_comm","prompt":"In class, you must (   ) on your teacher and listen well. に入る語は？","explanation":"focus on ... で「〜に集中する」。","category":"Switch2単語","type":"choice","choices":["focus","accept","provide","disturb"],"answer":"focus","acceptableAnswers":["focus"]},{"id":"english_comm-engc019","moduleId":"english_comm","prompt":"I need to write an (   ). に入る語は？","explanation":"applicationは「申し込み、応募」。","category":"Switch2単語","type":"choice","choices":["application","organization","emergency","reaction"],"answer":"application","acceptableAnswers":["application"]},{"id":"english_comm-engc020","moduleId":"english_comm","prompt":"Please be quiet and do not (   ) the baby. He is sleeping. に入る語は？","explanation":"disturbは「邪魔をする、乱す」。","category":"Switch2単語","type":"choice","choices":["disturb","reduce","accept","organize"],"answer":"disturb","acceptableAnswers":["disturb"]}]